      "summaries": {
        "en": "Crawl4AI is an open-source web crawler designed to extract clean, LLM-ready data from websites. Its key innovation is automatic content extraction that removes clutter (ads, nav bars) and outputs structured formats like Markdown or JSON, saving preprocessing time. You can use it via a simple Python API to feed web data directly into RAG pipelines, fine-tuning datasets, or AI agents for research and automation.",
        "zh": "Crawl4AI 是一款开源网络爬虫，专为大语言模型（LLM）提取友好数据而设计。其核心优势在于自动去除广告、导航栏等干扰元素，直接输出干净的 Markdown 或 JSON 格式，省去繁琐的数据清洗步骤。技术上，通过智能内容提取算法将杂乱网页转化为结构化文本，适用于构建检索增强生成（RAG）系统的知识库、微调数据集或为 AI 代理提供实时网页信息。用户可通过简单 Python API 快速上手，高效获取高质量网页数据。",
        "es": "Crawl4AI is an open-source web crawler designed to extract clean, LLM-ready data from websites. Its key innovation is automatic content extraction that removes clutter (ads, nav bars) and outputs structured formats like Markdown or JSON, saving preprocessing time. You can use it via a simple Python API to feed web data directly into RAG pipelines, fine-tuning datasets, or AI agents for research and automation.",
        "sections": {
          "why": "crawl4ai gives teams a dependable path to production-ready AI tooling.",
          "what": "Crawl4AI is an open-source web crawler designed to extract clean, LLM-ready data from websites. Its key innovation is automatic content extraction that removes clutter (ads, nav bars) and outputs structured formats like Markdown or JSON, saving preprocessing time. You can use it via a simple Python API to feed web data directly into RAG pipelines, fine-tuning datasets, or AI agents for research and automation.",
          "how": "Review https://github.com/unclecode/crawl4ai for docs, run starter examples, and integrate with your pipeline or evaluation stack."
        }
