      "summaries": {
        "en": "Harness is a meta-skill framework for designing domain-specific agent teams. It defines specialized agents and generates the skills they use, enabling modular, scalable AI workflows. Technically, it treats agent orchestration as a meta-skill, allowing dynamic team composition and skill generation. Use it to build custom AI assistants for tasks like code review, data analysis, or customer support by defining agent roles and their capabilities.",
        "zh": "Harness 是一个元技能框架，用于设计领域特定的智能体团队。它定义专门的智能体并生成它们所需的技能，从而实现模块化、可扩展的 AI 工作流。其技术核心是将智能体编排视为一种元技能，允许动态组建团队和生成技能。你可以用它来构建自定义 AI 助手，例如代码审查、数据分析或客户支持，只需定义智能体角色及其能力即可。",
        "es": "Harness is a meta-skill framework for designing domain-specific agent teams. It defines specialized agents and generates the skills they use, enabling modular, scalable AI workflows. Technically, it treats agent orchestration as a meta-skill, allowing dynamic team composition and skill generation. Use it to build custom AI assistants for tasks like code review, data analysis, or customer support by defining agent roles and their capabilities.",
        "sections": {
          "why": "harness stands out for claude-code, claude-code-plugin, and harness in real-world workflows.",
          "what": "Harness is a meta-skill framework for designing domain-specific agent teams. It defines specialized agents and generates the skills they use, enabling modular, scalable AI workflows. Technically, it treats agent orchestration as a meta-skill, allowing dynamic team composition and skill generation. Use it to build custom AI assistants for tasks like code review, data analysis, or customer support by defining agent roles and their capabilities.",
          "how": "Review https://github.com/revfactory/harness for docs, run starter examples, and integrate with your pipeline or evaluation stack."
        }
